@startuml 게시글_작성

autonumber

actor User as U
participant BoardUI as B
participant "PostController\n(Flask API)" as PC
participant "BoardService" as BS
database DB

U -> B: 글쓰기 제출 {title, content, board_type}
B -> PC: POST /api/v1/posts {...}
PC -> BS: create_post(user_id, title, content, board_type)
BS -> DB: INSERT posts
alt 성공
  DB --> BS: new post_id
  BS --> PC: Post
  PC --> B: 201 Created
  B --> U: 작성 완료
else 실패(검증/DB)
  DB --> BS: error
  BS --> PC: 400/500
  PC --> B: 에러 코드+메시지
  B --> U: 수정/재시도 안내
end

@enduml


